{%- comment -%}
PFC Areas — life-wheel status per life area, mirroring the Trello Areas list.
Red/yellow areas lead with their notes (the why); green areas hold a compact
list. The rated date is always shown — past ~40 days the wheel itself is the
stale thing worth knowing (`stale`).

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles — framework classes only.
Status is the colour spelled out in caps (RED / YELLOW / GREEN) — never
punctuation, which needs a legend the screen doesn't carry. Areas needing
attention sort red first, then yellow.
{%- endcomment -%}
